[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14349.91, "timestamp": "03:59:09", "text": "今は良くなりましたか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14351.91, "timestamp": "03:59:11", "text": "私は飛んでいます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14355.59, "timestamp": "03:59:15", "text": "え、何？飛行機の調子はどうですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14358.229, "timestamp": "03:59:18", "text": "例えば、ボスを倒して、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14361.67, "timestamp": "03:59:21", "text": "都市では、翼が手に入ります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14364.07, "timestamp": "03:59:24", "text": "あなたを空へ飛ばしてくれるでしょう。待って、本当に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14365.75, "timestamp": "03:59:25", "text": "ボスを倒すには"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14368.03, "timestamp": "03:59:28", "text": "ボスを倒す？君ならできるよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14370.87, "timestamp": "03:59:30", "text": "いいえ。あなたはそれをしなければなりませんが、あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14372.75, "timestamp": "03:59:32", "text": "構築しなければならない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14375.71, "timestamp": "03:59:35", "text": "都市を見つけるまで建設する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14378.229, "timestamp": "03:59:38", "text": "あなた自身。 O"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14381.189, "timestamp": "03:59:41", "text": "ボス戦エリアの端から"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14383.349, "timestamp": "03:59:43", "text": "まっすぐな道を建設しなければならない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14385.51, "timestamp": "03:59:45", "text": "ある都市を見つける。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14387.189, "timestamp": "03:59:47", "text": "ああ、"}]